    "text": "By Grace Koennecke ,\n8 hours ago WAYNE COUNTY, W.Va. (WSAZ) - A trial is now underway for a man arrested on murder and arson charges in Wayne County in December of 2024. Joshua Murrow was arrested in connection with a deadly fire that killed two people in the 2100 block of Spring Valley Drive in Wayne County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
